flowchart LR
  SOURCE[Caption source] --> STATE[Revision state: newer revisions and final lock]
  subgraph SERVER[Server: one asyncio event loop]
    STATE -->|finals| HISTORY[Bounded final history]
    STATE --> POLICY[Broadcast and per-client overload policy]
    STATE -. active snapshot .-> JOIN[Client handler]
    HISTORY -. recovery .-> JOIN
    subgraph SESSIONS[Independent client sessions: cleanup and monitoring]
      Q1[Queue 1: 256 messages / 1 MiB] --> TX1[Sender task 1]
      QN[Queue N: 256 messages / 1 MiB] --> TXN[Sender task N]
    end
    POLICY --> Q1
    POLICY --> QN
    JOIN -. initial batch .-> SESSIONS
  end
  TX1 --> BROWSER[Each browser: revision checks, live view and final recall]
  TXN --> BROWSER
  BROWSER -. HELLO and final cursor .-> JOIN
